          "text": "Test fixture text. This tote is worked from the base up in rounds, then the handles are added and the cherry charms are sewn on last."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Dense single crochet keeps the shape firm enough to stand on its own."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Materials"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
